{"id": "msg_84f0dd32f1e249b39bfb201890aebaa9", "role": "assistant", "parts": [{"type": "text", "text": "已按你的要求做了 **v3**（[detail.vue](<zhi2-web-admin/src/views/publicQuery/monthlyReportStat/detail.vue>)）：\n\n1. **顶部常驻横向滚动条** `.stat-table-xbar`（高 12px），与表体 `scrollLeft` 双向同步。\n2. **仅在表格区内纵向滚**：`.stat-table-wrap` 为 `overflow-y: auto` + `overflow-x: hidden`（底部不再出现横向条，避免双轨）。\n3. **整页不纵向滚**：`pageScroll: false`（浏览器 eval 已测）。\n\n**实机证据（含顶栏条位置）**\n![验证-顶栏横向滚动条v3](<C:/Users/Administrator/AppData/Local/Temp/verify2730-20261125-152000-top-xbar.png>)\n\n请在 **8101 详情页** 看：表格**标题下方**是否有一条可拖的**横向细滚条**；拖动后右侧区县列应跟着动；**整页不应再出现右侧整条页面滚动条**，纵向只在表格白底区域内滚。\n\n请确认是否可过验证门；若顶栏条不够显眼或要和表头「贴边」，说下期望我再调样式（高度/颜色/与表头间距）。"}, {"type": "tool", "tool_id": "call-2e605779-6374-4306-9155-c01d766bc7f4-composer_call_DUvBL8Yr__fc_9cfbbfea-6931-45f0-bd58-12539719c183_0", "tool_name": "ask_user_question", "tool_uri": "", "skill_uri": "", "tool_status": "running", "tool_input": {"questions": [{"id": "verify_v3", "question": "顶栏横向条 + 仅表格内纵向滚，是否满足？", "header": "验证v3", "options": [{"label": "通过", "description": "继续提交/禅道"}, {"label": "顶栏条要更明显/加高", "description": "改 UI 样式"}, {"label": "仍有问题", "description": "下条消息说明"}], "multi_select": false}]}}], "created_at": "2026-11-25T07:19:48.877Z", "peer_id": "gitlab.zhi.com-zhi-suzhou-shiqu-suzhufang-fe-zhi2-web-admin-h5-g-unlimited"}
